#: scenario8:scenario8_6859F8BA_2B60_443D_A146_6359F9BCC8F3
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d5cbe1f2af412e7fc63a049ae0398f1ead5cece09627d2851a5f5265fc331e8a
#. default-sha256: da50156ac9e7006b1feedcf6dc487bc536107c85f54b2dfa6c86fabdf2bbc769
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_6859F8BA_2B60_443D_A146_6359F9BCC8F3"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫That endless expanse of red earth"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫붉은기가 도는 흙이 영원히 이어지는 게――"

#: scenario8:scenario8_A4A3F35D_D62F_4F2A_B280_64EB88F05101
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 332c174bf9f33c453a648726bae862bf365e9b17985bd80c4e9094ed464a90ec
#. default-sha256: 10b6d65bed94e8a84c797e112d706cdcc4f1f2a04ae8021a8c939eb3c5ee6d74
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_A4A3F35D_D62F_4F2A_B280_64EB88F05101"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫remains branded into the very fabric of my mind."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫뇌리에 새겨져 있다."

#: scenario8:scenario8_86014BCE_50E9_48BD_9AD2_C18A9B08E47F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b6832fced765d9c09f43b950685087026908400537fb8b18f31266d41cb98faf
#. default-sha256: 70f78e4543a4c15e0a35a83de9c91813fd18edb7ed5fb0e77ba5b6f60a953f9c
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_86014BCE_50E9_48BD_9AD2_C18A9B08E47F"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫That’s where it was decided someone built like I am would be the most use, I suppose."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫나는 몸이 튼튼했으니…… ⟪k:1⟫그런 쪽으로 써먹기 편했을 거다."

#: scenario8:scenario8_EFE14CCC_A8CF_4BAA_BE17_57EA45F3D07C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c256bde8d29e7c8d0a45c8d6b5faaa35531c4c8a2a41d2bb61c5abc43d2539de
#. default-sha256: 46fe628991f7dd77fd74d40c616e028a8f70afd15c562fbb4a8322d8c846a167
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_EFE14CCC_A8CF_4BAA_BE17_57EA45F3D07C"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫But I could tell from their tone of voice and expressions that the things they were saying "
"were not friendly. ⟪k:1⟫They seemed to be mocking me, laughing at me."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫하지만 ⟪k:1⟫그 자들이 우호적이지 않은 건 ⟪k:2⟫어조나 표정을 보면 확연했지. ⟪k:3⟫모멸과 조소"
"가 담긴…… 분위기였거든……."

#: scenario8:scenario8_CDC5F7AC_8330_457D_B164_F088B8DEC181
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7a2a4786791c4e69476cb3a15fef7d3677c16032a18d61633ffa9dedfa764d57
#. default-sha256: b077c76ee26514bef3d317cac8c3d48eb59592c6b4b31cf656e3e948abadd485
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_CDC5F7AC_8330_457D_B164_F088B8DEC181"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫As you might expect, I attempted to protest,⟪k:1⟫but evidently, I had been beaten quite "
"badly while I was unconscious."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫나는 당연히…… 저항을 시도했는데, ⟪k:1⟫이미 타격을 입은 후였는지, ⟪k:2⟫삭신이 쑤셔서 움직이기 "
"힘들었고――"

#: scenario8:scenario8_189711F9_D6CC_485D_95C3_728672FF3E07
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b51e34c0e38cfa92977f2cf6d94bbc2fbadea6993cf963b28c10bd7f6792be04
#. default-sha256: 11bb7e3264f2e2826b2d02347d2647c44d7f75d5e67aa225ef9a3c51735e6d1c
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_189711F9_D6CC_485D_95C3_728672FF3E07"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫My joints were stiff and swollen, on top of my dehydration,⟪k:1⟫so I could barely move, let "
"alone put up a fight."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫수분 섭취도 제대로 못 한 상태였을 거다. ⟪k:1⟫갈증이 심하여…… 몸에 힘이 안 들어갔지."

#: scenario8:scenario8_64D83DD8_B6FF_487B_AA17_AC0B63B424CF
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 54f9175a92eaae0664ed31ec3354badb6301edf00ed8afe2a8d7abba08a620bd
#. default-sha256: 468e4603e1328d82bf901ad728840f45b273f858f17908dc3075899824c825e3
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_64D83DD8_B6FF_487B_AA17_AC0B63B424CF"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫As strong as I might have been at full health, I was in no condition to do anything then."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫아무리 실력에 자신이 있어도, ⟪k:1⟫그런 상황에선 아무것도 못 한다."

#: scenario8:scenario8_475C661B_0BE8_4B09_A455_E9CE8A5CCB88
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 32a766d99b1201cb81644930fab72a25e04add64adbe5e565c908e86f33d989b
#. default-sha256: 80bf257a18b4e9701936ad534bdbb633a1d1fa577815865a9346cb13cd4ec412
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_475C661B_0BE8_4B09_A455_E9CE8A5CCB88"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫They had many words to describe me, none of them flattering.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Some of them would "
"even call me “beast.”"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫놈들은 나를 온갖 말로 욕했다. ⟪k:1⟫아아, ⟪k:2⟫짐승이라 불리기도 했나……."

#: scenario8:scenario8_5244F813_E939_4660_BDB7_59797A6E7A7D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 36b7dc96dc278560eaf3b39d4941d514c3fa828ab8b83b94452ca69b96b86892
#. default-sha256: 7b9a38bd30fa3522419046eb385868b0809c3eebe6c7dc291413016d1230b8ec
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_5244F813_E939_4660_BDB7_59797A6E7A7D"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The slave trader’s guards were armed, of course.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Swords hanging from their hips, "
"ready to cut down anyone who showed any sign of resistance."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫마차를 감시하는 노예상인의 호위는 ⟪k:1⟫당연히 검을 찼으니――⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫저항하면 죽을 게 불 보"
"듯 뻔했다."

#: scenario8:scenario8_95934EAA_5C56_448B_B646_04C8D400B5E6
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: fbb8dd28827d28c389c4c41ff9ea6ae9d140bcd6b376940cbee4ec8fb8a167de
#. default-sha256: 89bc3bc67da79c58f525e15327da71c2e8f0e51a2d39e3ca65a71f43d75b78da
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_95934EAA_5C56_448B_B646_04C8D400B5E6"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫So they sat there, lamenting their fate."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫그래서…… ⟪k:1⟫모두 ⟪k:2⟫본인의 전말을 한탄하며 ⟪k:3⟫우려했지."

#: scenario8:scenario8_54ADD76B_A412_4AFA_BA50_2C9D1C49BD83
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7b3633382c51db419ed49e637a59a466a69f27cc0812b951ca7a482a5664401b
#. default-sha256: 02bf54de1a7b90b38965d40901e22ae76b605180d8c8e62f59b980016e915c91
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_54ADD76B_A412_4AFA_BA50_2C9D1C49BD83"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Glancing over at her, I caught a glimpse of her face—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫large chunks of skin "
"seemed to have fallen off it."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫그래서 그 얼굴을 흘깃 봤는데, ⟪k:1⟫기묘했다.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫그건…… 피부가 문드러진 건지……."

#: scenario8:scenario8_3C09BB0D_D06D_4694_AFEE_33B7DB1722FE
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3e12311c45f0d1861b9ac934a35153f9fbeb6a69c5d6a450715b7ea281983684
#. default-sha256: e8b99ef78e2b8b0152d685b2e1a98dab0d7facdb84944900debe1de135fc6385
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_3C09BB0D_D06D_4694_AFEE_33B7DB1722FE"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫It was, suffice it to say, an unusual sight."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫추한 얼굴이었다."

#: scenario8:scenario8_EA4C890F_1548_4752_A156_2A7C16C62C10
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 58885fd001eb906231bc85f70ada21892fe6bd952dd7fd277b5bdd61bcf34768
#. default-sha256: 125be264e31840b84730a1727849de3bb571690e5163ce7cd67d0a801b72e0aa
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_EA4C890F_1548_4752_A156_2A7C16C62C10"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I’m not sure how to describe it... ⟪k:1⟫but it seemed different somehow from everyone else "
"crying in the carriage. It was almost like..."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫뭐라 표현해야 할까…… 남들과 다르게 보였다. ⟪k:1⟫우는 녀석은 많이 있었지만, ⟪k:2⟫그건, ⟪k:3⟫그"
"래――"

#: scenario8:scenario8_F2B7BADB_C3EA_40B1_AEE7_6D49DE1D5C3D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ef3ad90a2748cdd18975e052185d6682bfbf1173a98abbbc9ca4832317195e37
#. default-sha256: 65dae013b74ee55359853765bd02605e4f631b3eeab7e50c9a9b0433982af156
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_F2B7BADB_C3EA_40B1_AEE7_6D49DE1D5C3D"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫her tears were not for herself."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫자신을 위해 우는 게 아니었다."

#: scenario8:scenario8_4121FD91_F6D5_45F3_9CE9_623725AE1CC9
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f9033e7ea2ca45d98d53a8b4be8d4494f949161f0d7a645784248e86c13d5410
#. default-sha256: 8b55e0f2ec09c2549b1dac686772e40bb9e5cee3392a5bbea23e498c6f10b490
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_4121FD91_F6D5_45F3_9CE9_623725AE1CC9"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Why are you crying?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫……너는 왜 울지……?"

#: scenario8:scenario8_D6308C27_83A4_4537_B693_124430D2D1DC
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 67dcae7d8c74502baa74f252e58ced0bd900abee7ea282669eb8cb07903cba16
#. default-sha256: f90fab89c21bbf20355d1059bab72951415cbce353db134915fa208090d193f7
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_D6308C27_83A4_4537_B693_124430D2D1DC"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫After a moment’s hesitation, she said,"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫그 녀석은 조금 주저한 후에 ⟪k:1⟫이 말을 했다."

#: scenario8:scenario8_8D93A337_D2B1_4263_88A0_79A5D2C433CA
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e1fe55a4a5e4cf6a05a6b3a75190cf33945adbddd8aa190d3910d36223dd39df
#. default-sha256: 07f033db97fc9658cbfe9a4d11da69c005e0b7e4a4ae55d2226c38a48abe4079
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_8D93A337_D2B1_4263_88A0_79A5D2C433CA"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫For a moment, I was filled with a sense of tranquility,"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫평온한 바람이…… 아주 조금 ⟪k:1⟫내 마음 속에 불었다."

#: scenario8:scenario8_DD5FAAB1_FB91_428F_A8DF_2C1B7B49DC0C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 47263d2a29980acbe8f2a5ca00826c02fca392b97c742dc5cbe2eaec91e7fbb7
#. default-sha256: b64c82ee2138dfbae93ebe99b57aebfdcd591f69abcf2542498b5cc541ac4590
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_DD5FAAB1_FB91_428F_A8DF_2C1B7B49DC0C"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫and though you may not believe it,"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫나는 ⟪k:1⟫그때…… ⟪k:2⟫믿기 힘들겠지만……"

#: scenario8:scenario8_6C1999A0_BBCE_491A_9F11_3AA8BB65B59D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 65db24e6201507fcf9d52c5b37dde4e455c1020996ea11c1c0b807b0e57e865a
#. default-sha256: 756b00347c8a4fa0cf0eeb339a1a85cca1d12e1da76f860a3beb96a7327235d2
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_6C1999A0_BBCE_491A_9F11_3AA8BB65B59D"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫This is no lie, I promise."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫거짓말이…… ⟪k:1⟫아니다……."

#: scenario8:scenario8_D377934A_089F_403D_A7CE_0876CD37C5EE
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e4f9f9acb08a5da4c4cbe551ba1213d134ecdd0d3095e9bfb1c201da91f9fc4e
#. default-sha256: 31b54adc12e8b28c98d65600e59c1d439b16301d3d9228e49b6b12fab27675af
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_D377934A_089F_403D_A7CE_0876CD37C5EE"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫............"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫…………."

#: scenario8:scenario8_C75B6762_6766_41AE_BA3B_52BF6A5BD0F5
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 4cb7ff7ab664cb251328863ea953e57ed268b0dd6580b02ca409848f5cd73ce2
#. default-sha256: 860e614701237ab043e5f074927df78ab2c2928e093e03c45f1cc1ba57486fac
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_C75B6762_6766_41AE_BA3B_52BF6A5BD0F5"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I’m begging you!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫……살려 줘……!!"

#: scenario8:scenario8_1774CFC9_2512_4570_AE5C_B1ACDF30C87C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 64bb2471f53f95433ca0015677befaa0d29dce85118c3f6040a3a316f3ebc5c0
#. default-sha256: 1b9b7b81181660cee1e4a24d28e8a16f551dd99dbca652192314129294413e7f
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_1774CFC9_2512_4570_AE5C_B1ACDF30C87C"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫They let their guard down because we were restrained.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫The thought of anyone "
"resisting never once crossed their minds."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫어쩌면…… 수갑 때문에 놈들이 방심했을 가능성도 있나.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫설마 역습하는 자가 있을 줄은―― "
"상상도 못 했을 거다."

#: scenario8:scenario8_A91022C2_DDC8_404F_9E06_8CCEBACC812E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 376195c054774f42d165fd8c085855416521fb53353c2413da6a0e2b632fd3ab
#. default-sha256: e31aebac0dfeffa7f59838122ec1e0f781d6a9d516816e4e5e77a554585e3396
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_A91022C2_DDC8_404F_9E06_8CCEBACC812E"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Haha... ⟪k:1⟫hahahaha... ⟪k:2⟫heehee!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫하하……, ⟪k:1⟫……하하하하……, ⟪k:2⟫……히히……!"

#: scenario8:scenario8_63E11C4C_470B_45C4_BDF5_9D1910BA3315
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d44cafc527e5ec544662800354b6d12a020596400c50a17e373eed360938e3c9
#. default-sha256: b7e8561ca1a88fe7a734c9bc607d38b9950b7e81f3520c7772e72295fc9cc378
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_63E11C4C_470B_45C4_BDF5_9D1910BA3315"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫More... ⟪k:1⟫I need more...⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫I need moooooooooooore!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫부족해……, ⟪k:1⟫이걸론 부족해……, ⟪k:2⟫부족해애애애애애……!"

#: scenario8:scenario8_38158AE4_64C6_491B_98D3_B0BE5DA55015
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ed474a026f6fb9a3e5945b60c62ca7149db136a4db6907c3d3e09736966069ef
#. default-sha256: 79bca7b4fca7ac6c040acc2e77eb9eb65d719f26933dbce4fdf118a9ee0fae12
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_38158AE4_64C6_491B_98D3_B0BE5DA55015"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫But she said nothing, simply removing my shackles as commanded."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫그 소녀는 ⟪k:1⟫아무 말도 않고 내 수갑을 풀었다."

#: scenario8:scenario8_707AA80E_C68A_4C08_8E5F_B7EA77E984E7
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 8e932b8bc0dde7cecf97a24201ab2876f00861870b36625629d482c7487476e0
#. default-sha256: 9009e1b24bdf570b5e95cf05028a62ee6a9e96bd88e226612505c4cfdc758e76
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_707AA80E_C68A_4C08_8E5F_B7EA77E984E7"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫We can have our lives back!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫……평화로운 생활을 되찾을 수 있어……!"

#: scenario8:scenario8_D2F5D64A_E594_4284_9082_612E7FE2398A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a105899948128f7c1a566c2f288e9585ea82d4984e5bc1d3c99946bfcbcf6cb7
#. default-sha256: 83a26181a9dbd18dace0f7d4d4603660f308626b2ae36da079e1f5e23d019e6d
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_D2F5D64A_E594_4284_9082_612E7FE2398A"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Undo our shackles, please!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫부디…… 우리 수갑도 빨리!"

