"⟪k:0⟫In retrospect, that was probably my fault too.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫As I pushed her toward wanting to be "
"a regular girl,"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫지금 돌이키면…… ⟪k:1⟫그것도 내 탓이었겠군.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫내가 폴린에게 ⟪k:4⟫평범한 여자로 사는 욕"
"구를 품게 해서――"

