msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫But what could a killer like me do to help?⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Petty thievery wouldn’t make me nearly "
"enough money to keep a church and orphanage running,"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫하지만 고작 살인자가 ⟪k:1⟫뭐가 가능하겠나?⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫강도짓만으론 ⟪k:4⟫교회와 고아원 운영에 보"
"탬이 안 된다."

#: scenario8:scenario8_9E06B6B9_FD2D_42BB_9961_4C907D85E5A7
