msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫and a raid large enough in scale to do so would inevitably be traced back to the source, "
"which would ruin the church forever."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫보탬이 될 만큼 요란한 학살을 저지른다 치면……⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫쉽게 덜미를 잡혀 ⟪k:3⟫그 녀석의 교회가 "
"망한다."

